== Reward ==

<ul><li>  {{:Dark Oak Shillelagh}}
</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

Find [[Shrub Marwood]] in the eastern hideout of the Firiona Vie outpost.

You say, 'Hail, Shrub Marwood'

Shrub Marwood brushes pollen off of his tunic. 'Aachoo!!  Oh!! Hello.  Please look around.  Unless you are a [druid looking for work].'

You say, 'I am a druid looking for work'

: Shrub Marwood says 'Good.  I need a stout adventurer to go to the wilds and find me a few items.  I need some tump stumps - one Kromdul and one Kromdek type.  I also need a mantrap root.  Get me those three things and I will give you this handy shillelagh I found in the forest.'

'''The items he needs:'''

* One [[Tump Stump|Kromdul Stump]] (forest giants in Burning Woods or Firiona Vie)
* One [[Tump Stump|Kromdek Stump]] (forest giants in Frontier Mountains)
* One [[Mantrap Root]] ([[erollisi mantrap]] in the Emerald Jungle, [[Weeping Mantrap]] in Swamp of No Hope)

Note: I was unable to get the Root off of the Mantraps in EJ, but got it on the first try in TT.

'''Give him those three items, and in exchange you will receive a [[Dark Oak Shillelagh]], some faction, and some experience.'''

: Shrub Marwood says 'Hey!!  Trying to pull a fast one?!!  I said I wanted tump stumps of Kromdek and Kromdul type and a mantrap root!!'

Shrub Marwood tosses the mantrap root out the window.. SPLASH!!  'I made a mistake.  I didn't need that one.  Here is the shillelagh I told you about.  I found it in some burned out woods far from here.  I cleaned it up and found it had a spark of mana so I had it enchanted with a few charges of my spell, [Fertile Crop]. Hope you like it.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Inhabitants of Firiona Vie]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Emerald Warriors]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Storm Guard]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Legion of Cabilis]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Pirates Of Gunthak]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

The fertile crop he mentions is the lead-in to the [[Beguile Plants Quest|Beguile Plants]] quest.

